  },
  "environmentmanagement/environment-groups/get-environment-group-operation": {
   "summary": "Operation Read",
   "notes": [
    "Verified live (2026-08-27): the returned operation is a BAP lifecycle operation (status in state.id, transitioning NotStarted to Succeeded; stages Validate, Prepare, Run, Finalize), not an environment-group-specific type. An unknown or absent operation id returns 204 No Content."
   ],
   "responses": {
    "200": {
     "schema": {
      "$ref": "BapLifecycleOperation"
     },
     "description": "The lifecycle operation. Verified against the live API."
    },
    "204": {
     "description": "No Content. Returned for an unknown or absent operation id (verified against the live API)."
    }
   }
  },
  "environmentmanagement/environment-groups/list-environment-groups": {
   "summary": "List"
  },
  "environmentmanagement/environment-groups/remove-environment-from-group": {
   "summary": "Environment Remove",
   "notes": [
    "Removes a single environment (the path environmentId) from the group; there is no whole-list replace.",
    "Same 202 plus Location async transport as add; poll the returned Location header, see [Read Operation](#/operations/environmentmanagement_getEnvironmentGroupOperation).",
    "Membership is validated synchronously, so removing an environment that is not currently a member returns 400 InputValidationError. A remove issued before an async add has settled will fail this way."
   ],
   "responses": {
    "202": {
     "headers": {
      "Location": {
       "description": "URL of the environment-group lifecycle operation to poll, of the form /environmentmanagement/environmentGroupOperations/{operationId}?api-version=1. Undocumented; verified against the live API.",
       "schema": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uri"
       }
      }
     }
    }
   }
  },
